1
00:00:04,254 --> 00:00:05,589
Why the long face?

2
00:00:08,217 --> 00:00:10,677
I think I was
too nervous

3
00:00:10,802 --> 00:00:11,802
No,

4
00:00:11,845 --> 00:00:13,263
you did a great job

5
00:00:15,057 --> 00:00:16,725
Thank you
for saying that

6
00:00:18,101 --> 00:00:20,354
You know I helped you
so much today, right?

7
00:00:20,479 --> 00:00:22,564
Yeah, that's why
I'm saying thank you

8
00:00:22,689 --> 00:00:24,024
Is that all?

9
00:00:24,149 --> 00:00:25,149
What do you mean?

10
00:00:26,109 --> 00:00:28,028
You could say
more than that

11
00:00:28,153 --> 00:00:29,196
For example…

12
00:00:30,322 --> 00:00:32,741
"I'll buy you a coffee"

13
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:34,243
or "I'll treat you dinner"

14
00:00:34,368 --> 00:00:35,369
"How about a drink?"…

15
00:00:35,494 --> 00:00:36,286
Okay, got it

16
00:00:36,411 --> 00:00:37,788
I'll treat you dinner

17
00:00:37,913 --> 00:00:39,081
Keep your words

18
00:00:39,206 --> 00:00:40,206
Tonight, okay?

19
00:00:44,086 --> 00:00:46,380
I was gonna treat you
to a fancy dinner

20
00:00:46,505 --> 00:00:48,131
Why did you want it
at home?

21
00:00:48,257 --> 00:00:49,091
Well…

22
00:00:49,216 --> 00:00:51,927
I just needed
some rest at home

23
00:00:53,887 --> 00:00:54,930
I'm swamped these days

24
00:00:56,223 --> 00:00:57,663
and I wanted some
alone time with you

25
00:00:59,685 --> 00:01:01,019
Okay, please dig in

26
00:01:01,144 --> 00:01:02,144
Thank you

27
00:01:06,650 --> 00:01:09,027
You don't seem to visit
your family very often

28
00:01:09,152 --> 00:01:10,612
I was raised
by my grandma

29
00:01:11,697 --> 00:01:12,857
but she's not here
anymore now

30
00:01:14,616 --> 00:01:15,616
Oh, I'm sorry

31
00:01:16,994 --> 00:01:18,078
It's okay

32
00:01:18,203 --> 00:01:19,203
It's been a long time

33
00:01:20,372 --> 00:01:21,372
What about you, Hyesung?

34
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,000
I…

35
00:01:26,795 --> 00:01:29,506
I don't really get along
with my parents

36
00:01:29,631 --> 00:01:32,217
They always stayed
with me when shooting

37
00:01:32,342 --> 00:01:34,094
so we often
had a falling-out

38
00:01:34,219 --> 00:01:36,596
So none of us is
close to family, huh?

39
00:01:36,722 --> 00:01:38,282
We should get along
with each other then
